      "heading": "About Scenario Studio",
      "id": "about",
      "intro": "Scenario Studio adalah visual editor drag-and-drop untuk merancang aturan deteksi fraud menggunakan kanvas ReactFlow. Dengan dua tipe rule (GENERAL 3 langkah, CONDITION 4 langkah) dan 6 tipe kondisi, Anda dapat membangun logika deteksi kompleks tanpa menulis kode.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "What is Scenario Studio",
          "desc": "Scenario Studio adalah visual editor drag-and-drop untuk mendefinisikan aturan deteksi fraud. Rule direpresentasikan sebagai node kondisi yang saling terhubung di atas kanvas ReactFlow. Tersedia dua tipe rule: GENERAL (3 langkah) dan CONDITION (4 langkah dengan attribute binding).",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#ffffff;overflow:hidden;\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8fafc,#ffffff);border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n    <div style=\"width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8B5CF6,#6366f1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;\">S</div>\n    <div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#1e293b;\">Scenario Studio</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#64748b;\">Visual rule editor for fraud detection</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;padding:10px 12px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n      <div style=\"width:28px;height:28px;min-width:28px;border-radius:6px;background:#8B5CF6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-size:12px;\">1</div>\n      <div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;\">Drag-and-Drop Canvas</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#64748b;\">Build detection rules visually</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;padding:10px 12px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n      <div style=\"width:28px;height:28px;min-width:28px;border-radius:6px;background:#6366f1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-size:12px;\">2</div>\n      <div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;\">Condition Nodes</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#64748b;\">Connect logic with visual blocks</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;padding:10px 12px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n      <div style=\"width:28px;height:28px;min-width:28px;border-radius:6px;background:#3b82f6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-size:12px;\">3</div>\n      <div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;\">Rule Types</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#64748b;\">GENERAL (3 steps) &amp; CONDITION (4 steps)</div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "The 4-Step Workflow",
          "desc": "Setiap rule melalui alur kerja berurutan: (1) Configure Parameters — atur nama, grup, prioritas, risk score, active period, dan cycle indicator. (2) Build Flow — bangun logika deteksi pada canvas visual. (3) Use Condition — definisikan kondisi penggunaan (khusus CONDITION). (4) Review & Submit — tinjau konfigurasi dan submit.",
          "color": "#f97316",
          "bg": "#fff7ed",
          "previewHtml": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#ffffff;padding:16px;\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\">\n        <div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;min-width:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#8B5CF6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">\n          <svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:2px;height:24px;background:#e2e8f0;margin:4px 0;\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;padding:4px 0;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#1e293b;\">Configure Parameters</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#64748b;\">Name, group, priority &amp; risk score</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\">\n        <div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;min-width:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#6366f1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">2</div>\n        <div style=\"width:2px;height:24px;background:#e2e8f0;margin:4px 0;\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;padding:4px 0;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Build Flow</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#64748b;\">Create detection logic on canvas</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\">\n        <div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;min-width:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#3b82f6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">3</div>\n        <div style=\"width:2px;height:24px;background:#e2e8f0;margin:4px 0;\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;padding:4px 0;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Use Condition</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#64748b;\">Define usage conditions</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\">\n        <div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;min-width:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">4</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;padding:4px 0;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Review &amp; Submit</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#64748b;\">Review and submit configuration</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
