        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Understanding Canvas Area",
          "desc": "Canvas adalah area ReactFlow utama di tengah layout. Panel kiri berisi 6 tipe kondisi yang bisa di-drag. Toolbar bawah floating berisi info rule, Add Condition, Auto-arrange, Back, dan Continue. Navigasi dengan Space+Drag untuk pan, Scroll untuk zoom, dan drag node untuk memindahkannya.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#ffffff;overflow:hidden;\">\n  <div style=\"padding:8px 12px;background:#f8fafc;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\">\n    <div style=\"width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#ef4444;\"></div>\n    <div style=\"width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#f59e0b;\"></div>\n    <div style=\"width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;\"></div>\n    <span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;margin-left:4px;\">Build Formula</span>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"position:relative;padding:16px;min-height:140px;background:#f1f5f9;\">\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(#cbd5e1 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:16px 16px;\"></div>\n    <div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;gap:12px;\">\n      <div style=\"width:80px;padding:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:8px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-weight:700;color:#475569;margin-bottom:4px;\">ASSETS</div>\n        <div style=\"padding:3px 5px;border-radius:3px;background:#f8fafc;margin-bottom:3px;color:#94a3b8;\">Search...</div>\n        <div style=\"padding:3px 5px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(139,92,246,0.08);color:#8B5CF6;font-weight:600;\">Conditions</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;\">\n        <div style=\"padding:8px 12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #dbeafe;border-left:3px solid #3b82f6;\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#1e293b;\">IF transaction &gt; $10,000</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Amount check condition</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;margin:4px 0;\">\n          <div style=\"width:2px;height:16px;background:#cbd5e1;\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"padding:8px 12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #fef3c7;border-left:3px solid #f59e0b;\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#1e293b;\">AND country = \"High Risk\"</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Geo condition</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:8px;left:8px;right:8px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:7px;color:#94a3b8;\">\n      <span>50%</span>\n      <span>Conditions: 2</span>\n      <span>+ Add Condition</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Building Logic with Conditions",
          "desc": "Gunakan 6 tipe kondisi dari sidebar: LOGICAL (AND/OR/NOT/XOR), CONTAINS (string matching), CONSTANT (nilai tetap), DEVIATION (threshold persentase), AGGREGATE (count/sum/rate), GEO (jangkauan geografis). Hubungkan node output ke node input untuk membentuk alur deteksi.",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#ffffff;padding:16px;\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:8px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#475569;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;\">Condition Library</span>\n    <span style=\"font-size:9px;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f5f3ff;color:#8B5CF6;font-weight:600;\">9 types</span>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:4px;\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f8fafc;\">\n      <div style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid rgba(99,102,241,0.3);background:rgba(99,102,241,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:9px;color:#6366f1;\">A</div>\n      <div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;\">Aggregate</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Count/sum in window</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f8fafc;\">\n      <div style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.3);background:rgba(245,158,11,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:9px;color:#f59e0b;\">D</div>\n      <div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;\">Deviation</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Threshold %</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f8fafc;\">\n      <div style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.3);background:rgba(59,130,246,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:9px;color:#3b82f6;\">C</div>\n      <div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;\">Contains</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">String matching</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f8fafc;\">\n      <div style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid rgba(236,72,153,0.3);background:rgba(236,72,153,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:9px;color:#ec4899;\">G</div>\n      <div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;\">Geo</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Range detection</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f8fafc;\">\n      <div style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,0.3);background:rgba(34,197,94,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:9px;color:#22c55e;\">S</div>\n      <div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;\">Statement</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">SQL-based</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f8fafc;\">\n      <div style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.3);background:rgba(139,92,246,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:9px;color:#8B5CF6;\">IP</div>\n      <div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;\">Geo IP</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">IP lookup</div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Using Advanced Features",
          "desc": "Canvas mendukung fitur produktivitas: Undo/Redo (Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Shift+Z, 50 langkah history), Clipboard (Ctrl+C/X/V untuk node & grup), Groups (group/ungroup/move-to-group dengan tidy layout), Color Picker (warna node & grup via context menu), Auto-arrange (tidy layout dagre hierarki), Connected Move (node terhubung ikut dipindahkan).",
          "color": "#ec4899",
          "bg": "#fdf2f8",
          "previewHtml": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#ffffff;padding:16px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#475569;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:10px;\">Advanced Features</div>\n  <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n      <div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;min-width:10px;border-radius:2px;background:#8B5CF6;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#1e293b;font-weight:600;\">Undo/Redo</div>\n      <span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:7px;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:#e2e8f0;color:#64748b;\">50 steps</span>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n      <div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;min-width:10px;border-radius:2px;background:#6366f1;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#1e293b;font-weight:600;\">Clipboard</div>\n      <span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:7px;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:#e2e8f0;color:#64748b;\">C/X/V</span>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n      <div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;min-width:10px;border-radius:2px;background:#3b82f6;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#1e293b;font-weight:600;\">Groups</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n      <div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;min-width:10px;border-radius:2px;background:#22c55e;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#1e293b;font-weight:600;\">Color Picker</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n      <div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;min-width:10px;border-radius:2px;background:#f59e0b;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#1e293b;font-weight:600;\">Auto-arrange</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n      <div style=\"width:10px;height:10px;min-width:10px;border-radius:2px;background:#ec4899;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#1e293b;font-weight:600;\">Connected Move</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 6,
          "title": "Submitting & Managing Rules",
          "desc": "Setelah selesai membangun logika di canvas, lanjut ke tahap Review & Submit. Periksa ringkasan konfigurasi, isi komentar submit, dan simpan scenario. Rule yang sudah disubmit akan muncul di daftar Scenario Management dan dapat diedit, diaktifkan/nonaktifkan, atau dihapus.",
          "color": "#22c55e",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#ffffff;overflow:hidden;\">\n  <div style=\"padding:14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px;\">\n      <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8B5CF6\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"/></svg>\n      <span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#1e293b;\">Review &amp; Confirm</span>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"height:4px;background:#e2e8f0;border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden;\">\n      <div style=\"width:100%;height:4px;background:#8B5CF6;border-radius:2px;\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding:14px;display:flex;gap:16px;\">\n    <div style=\"flex:1;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-bottom:8px;\">Checklist</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#22c55e\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9px;color:#475569;\">Rule name defined</span></div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#22c55e\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9px;color:#475569;\">Priority set</span></div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#22c55e\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9px;color:#475569;\">Risk score configured</span></div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9px;color:#94a3b8;\">Conditions validated</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"width:1px;background:#e2e8f0;\"></div>\n    <div style=\"flex:1;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-bottom:8px;\">Config Summary</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\"><span style=\"color:#475569;font-weight:600;\">Type:</span> GENERAL</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\"><span style=\"color:#475569;font-weight:600;\">Group:</span> Merchant</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\"><span style=\"color:#475569;font-weight:600;\">Priority:</span> <span style=\"color:#ef4444;font-weight:600;\">HIGH</span></div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\"><span style=\"color:#475569;font-weight:600;\">Risk:</span> <span style=\"color:#f59e0b;font-weight:600;\">MEDIUM</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;\">\n    <div style=\"padding:6px 16px;background:#8B5CF6;color:white;border-radius:6px;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;\">Complete Submit</div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
